          "innerHTML": "<div style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e;'>VP Creative Director — TBWA\\Chiat\\Day</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#11998e; margin:3px 0 6px;'>2020 – Present · Los Angeles, CA</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#52525b; line-height:1.6;'>Led creative vision for Nike, Apple, and Airbnb global campaigns. Built and managed 35-person design team. Increased agency revenue by 40% through new business wins totalling $120M.</div><br><div style='font-size:14px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e;'>Senior Art Director — Wieden+Kennedy</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#11998e; margin:3px 0 6px;'>2017 – 2020 · Portland, OR</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#52525b; line-height:1.6;'>Directed award-winning campaigns for Old Spice and Delta Airlines. Cannes Lions Gold winner 2019.</div></div>",
